ParentVault_deployment
├── roles
│   └── it should grant expected vault roles
├── core addresses
│   └── it should configure vault addresses from deployment config
├── adapters
│   ├── it should register Aave V3, Aave V4, and Compound V3 adapters
│   └── it should configure deployed adapters
├── CCIP config
│   └── it should set the default CCIP gas limit
├── initial active adapter
│   └── it should set Aave V3 as the initial active adapter
├── workflow router
│   └── it should configure constructor-granted router roles
└── ACE components
    ├── it should attach and configure the deployed policy engine
    ├── it should register ParentVault KYC
    ├── it should remove temporary deployer registry write permission
    └── it should hand off ACE roles
